# Voiceprint Recognition System - AI Agent Context

## Project Overview

ECAPA-TDNN based voiceprint recognition system for power cabinet operator authentication.
Flask Web application with SQLite storage and SpeechBrain voiceprint processing.

## Tech Stack

| Component | Technology | Description |
|-----------|------------|-------------|
| Backend | Flask | Web server |
| Frontend | HTML + CSS + JavaScript | Browser-based UI |
| Voiceprint | SpeechBrain ECAPA-TDNN | Pre-trained model, EER 0.170% |
| Audio | soundfile + scipy + ffmpeg | Audio processing |
| Deep Learning | PyTorch | Model inference |
| Database | SQLite | Users, voiceprints, logs |
| Env Manager | uv | Dependency & Python management |

## Quick Start

```bash
# Windows
.\scripts\setup.ps1
uv run python web_server.py

# Linux
bash scripts/setup.sh
uv run python web_server.py
```

## Common Commands

| Action | Command |
|---|---|
| Install deps | `uv sync` |
| Start server | `uv run python web_server.py` |
| Check env | `uv run python scripts/doctor.py` |
| Add package | `uv add <package>` |

## Project Structure

```
voiceprint-system/
├── web_server.py       # Flask server (main entry)
├── config.py           # Configuration (env var support)
├── database.py         # SQLite management
├── voiceprint.py       # Voiceprint processing core
├── pyproject.toml      # Project metadata & deps
├── uv.lock             # Locked dependencies
├── .python-version     # Python version pin
├── requirements.txt    # Compatibility only
├── scripts/
│   ├── setup.ps1       # Windows setup
│   ├── setup.sh        # Linux setup
│   └── doctor.py       # Environment check
├── templates/
│   └── index.html      # Frontend
├── static/
│   ├── css/style.css
│   └── js/app.js
└── data/               # Runtime data (not committed)
    ├── audio_files/
    ├── models/
    └── voiceprints.db
```

## Environment Variables

| Variable | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|
| VOICEPRINT_DATA_DIR | data | Data directory |
| VOICEPRINT_DB_PATH | data/voiceprints.db | Database path |
| VOICEPRINT_THRESHOLD | 0.75 | Similarity threshold |
| VOICEPRINT_SAMPLE_RATE | 16000 | Audio sample rate |
| VOICEPRINT_HOST | 0.0.0.0 | Server listen address |
| VOICEPRINT_PORT | 5000 | Server port |
| VOICEPRINT_DEBUG | false | Flask debug mode |

## API Endpoints

- GET /api/status - System status
- GET /api/users - User list
- POST /api/users - Add user
- DELETE /api/users/<id> - Delete user
- POST /api/voiceprint/register - Register voiceprint
- POST /api/voiceprint/register-batch - Batch register
- POST /api/voiceprint/identify - Speaker identification (1:N)
- POST /api/voiceprint/verify - Speaker verification (1:1)
- GET /api/logs - Verification logs
- DELETE /api/logs - Clear logs
- POST /api/reset - Reset system (admin)

## System Dependencies

- ffmpeg (audio format conversion)
- libsndfile (soundfile backend, Linux)
- portaudio (sounddevice backend, Linux)

## Notes

- First run auto-downloads ECAPA-TDNN model (~100MB)
- Model stored in data/models/ecapa_tdnn/
- Supports CUDA and CPU inference
- Python >=3.11,<3.13 required

